{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43923","headline":"送男左贬诗 · 林氏","name":"送男左贬诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"他日初投杼，勤王在饮冰。\n有辞期不罚，积毁竟相仍。\n谪宦今何在，衔冤犹未胜。\n天涯分越徼，驿骑速毘陵。\n肠断腹非苦，书传写岂能。\n泪添江水远，心剧海云蒸。\n明月珠难识，甘泉赋可称。\n但将忠报主，何惧点青蝇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43923.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43923","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}